# Copy this file to tests/post.env and adjust for your machine.
# tests/post.env is gitignored.

# Path to the Autodesk post binary. On macOS it ships inside the Fusion install:
#   /Users/<you>/Library/Application Support/Autodesk/webdeploy/production/<hash>/Autodesk Fusion.app/Contents/Libraries/Applications/CAM360/post
# Leave unset to have regression.sh auto-detect on macOS.
#
# POST_BIN=""

# Override fixture root if you want to run against a different fixture set.
# FIXTURES_DIR="$SCRIPT_DIR/fixtures"

# Path to the .mch machine config. Required for 4/5-axis fixtures — without it,
# those posts fail with "requires a machine configuration for N-axis toolpath".
# Fusion stores user machines under:
#   ~/Library/Application Support/Autodesk/Autodesk Fusion 360/<userhash>/.../CAMMachines/
# For Microfactory's U500XD2:
# MACHINE_FILE="$HOME/Library/Application Support/Autodesk/Autodesk Fusion 360/<userhash>/W.login/M2/<orghash>/CAMMachines/brother u500Xd2.mch"
